"Captives called helpers are told a rich buyer will free them; they are fed to monsters instead."
"The giants in the arena depths were kidnapped people, cursed and dumped there to fight."
"Some twisted monsters in the arena depths are summons that failed their integration."
"The demon Elasar truly owns the Sun City arena, and every worker there serves him unknowing."
"Elasar sells evolving monsters to the lords of Malari, who are racing to buy them."
